        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Confirmed modeling decision&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;No Pending parent state and no Pending Unpaid -&gt; Pending Paid transition. Initial guards are mutually exclusive.&lt;br&gt;Both initial states require staff approval. First unpaid orders require telephone confirmation; an unsuccessful call does not automatically cancel.&lt;br&gt;Financial evidence remains independent after checkout. Later-payment fulfillment handling remains TBD; never infer a transition.&lt;br&gt;Final nodes end fulfillment only. Payment/refund and staff inventory disposition remain separately tracked." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;">
